! IT_SPECIFIER - Iteration cycle control file for CMFGEN
!
! When present, this file forces a particular iteration sequence.
! The cycle is repeated unless the NORM option is found.
! Specify only one option per line. The number of consecutive
! iterations of the same type is specified by a number following
! the option (if no number is present, 1 is assumed).
!
! This file is read EVERY iteration by SPECIFY_IT_CYCLE_V3
! ($cmfdist/subs/specify_it_cycle_v3.f) and can be modified
! while the model is running.
!
! Available options:
!   LAM N              - Do N Lambda iterations (Ne fixed, T fixed)
!   FULL N             - Do N full iterations (BA computed, T varies)
!   FULL(FIXT) N       - Do N full iterations (BA computed, T fixed)
!   FULL(FIXBA) N      - Do N full iterations (BA held fixed, T varies)
!   FULL(FIXT,FIXBA) N - Do N full iterations (BA held fixed, T fixed)
!   DO_NG              - Force NG acceleration on next iteration
!   DO_AV              - Force population averaging on next iteration
!   NORM               - Return to normal CMFGEN iteration control
!                        (when reached, lower statements are ignored)
!   REVISE_R           - Force R-grid revision on next iteration
!
! Default: NORM (let CMFGEN decide via DO_LAM_AUTO, DO_NG, etc.)
!
! prepare_VADAT.py overwrites this file when iteration_strategy
! is specified in the YAML config. To use a custom strategy,
! set cmfgen.iteration_strategy in the YAML config.
!
NORM
